{"id":"n65234-2-6","stage":0,"title":"가지다 · 拥有","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65234-2-6-1","ko":"그거 지수 가방 아냐?","zh":"那不是智秀的包吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个，这里指眼前对方附近的包。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"1","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀的","explanation":"지수：人名“智秀”；与 가방 连用，省略所属助词 -의，表示“智秀的包”。","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"가방","meaning":"包","explanation":"가방：包；지수 가방 即“智秀的包”。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"不是……吗？","explanation":"아냐 是 아니야 的缩合，来自 아니다，用疑问形式确认或推测前面的事实；这里不是 알다（知道）的活用。","readings":[{"term":"아니다","audio":"/audio/66b2ad55d8645d92ed83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26878","senseId":"2","lemma":"아니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指与听话人较近的东西；这里指那个包。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"66b2ad55d8645d92","term":"아니다","zh":"不是；아냐? 表示“不是吗？”","audio":"/audio/66b2ad55d8645d92ed83.mp3","entryId":"26878","definition":"否定判断；아냐? 是 아니야? 的缩略，用疑问语气确认前面的内容。","pronunciation":["아니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bbe081b8e3e33a716885.mp3","speakerIndex"